<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1872432764"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1528415444"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Daisy"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花鋏キョウ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Petrichor"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:56.256"><div begin="00:08.424" end="03:36.123"><p begin="00:08.424" end="00:10.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">足りないもの探して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻觅着希冀之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i mo no sa ga shi te</span></p><p begin="00:10.951" end="00:12.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">行ったり来たりのDays<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辗转往复的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 't ta ri ki ta ri no days</span></p><p begin="00:12.890" end="00:16.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">遥か遠くから来る未来<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远道而来的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ru ka to o ku ka ra ku ru mi ra i</span></p><p begin="00:17.265" end="00:18.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">一つだけじゃないよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非只有一种</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to tsu da ke ja na i yo ne</span></p><p begin="00:19.451" end="00:21.032" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">簡単には見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以轻易寻见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ta n ni ha mi e na i</span></p><p begin="00:21.604" end="00:24.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">巡り廻る僕らのuniverse<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我那流转不息的宇宙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ri me gu ru bo ku ra no yu ni ba a su</span></p><p begin="00:25.559" end="00:30.145" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">あぁ 泡みたいに浮かび上がってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 如泡沫一般浮起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Aa a wa mi ta i ni u ka bi a ga 't te ku</span></p><p begin="00:30.879" end="00:33.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">期待しては落ち込んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满怀期待最终却又落空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ta i shi te ha o chi ko n de</span></p><p begin="00:34.008" end="00:38.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">あぁ 静かな孤独、夜を越えるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 静谧的孤独 跨越这漫漫长夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Aa shi zu ka na ko do ku yo ru wo ko e ru no</span></p><p begin="00:39.044" end="00:41.281" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">もう夢に逃げないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再逃离到梦境之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u yu me ni ni ge na i de</span></p><p begin="00:42.498" end="00:46.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">stay いつだって君は急ぎ</p><p begin="00:47.459" end="00:50.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">play 眠らない町で一人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自一人在这不眠之城</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Pray ne mu ra na i ma chi de hi to ri</span></p><p begin="00:51.700" end="00:53.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">想像してるよりも<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u zo u shi te ru yo ri mo ko u ka i su ru yo ri ha</span></p><p begin="00:54.183" end="00:55.648" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">後悔するよりは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与其继续想象 或是陷入悔恨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u zo u shi te ru yo ri mo ko u ka i su ru yo ri ha</span></p><p begin="00:56.402" end="00:58.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">スタートラインを描こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不如一起画出起跑线吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ta a to ra i n wo e ga ko u</span></p><p begin="00:59.855" end="01:02.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">大嫌いと大好きの繰り返し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在厌恶与喜爱间反复的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ki ra i to da i su ki no ku ri ka e shi</span></p><p begin="01:03.586" end="01:07.346" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">そんな日々でもいつか輝き出す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也终将绽放出光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na hi bi de mo i tsu ka ka ga ya ki da su</span></p><p begin="01:08.218" end="01:09.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">飛び出したい衝動が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在渴望飞奔而出的冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi da shi ta i sho u do u ga</span></p><p begin="01:09.975" end="01:11.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">消えてしまう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi da shi ta i sho u do u ga</span></p><p begin="01:12.187" end="01:16.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">君と願いを叶えよう Daisy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你一起实现愿望吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ne ga i wo ka na e yo u</span></p><p begin="01:17.021" end="01:20.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">無色透明なら何色にもなれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Daisy 若是无色透明便能成千般色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Daisy mu sho ku to u me i na ra na ni i ro ni mo na re ru</span></p><p begin="01:20.782" end="01:23.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">ねえ 鮮やかに染まる光の中踊る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 在染上鲜明色彩的光芒中起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne a za ya ka ni so ma ru hi ka ri no na ka o do ru</span></p><p begin="01:25.020" end="01:28.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">そう 雨上がり薄く描いてく様に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 仿如雨后的水珠逐渐散去迎来晴天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So a me a ga ri no shi zu ku ga ka wa i te ku yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:29.364" end="01:33.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">咲いた花この世界を彩ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盛开的花儿为这个世界赋予了色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i ta ha na ko no se ka i wo i ro do 't te i ku</span></p><p begin="01:36.550" end="01:38.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">飛び方を忘れたみたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛早已忘记了飞翔的方法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ka ta wo wa su re ta mi ta i ni</span></p><p begin="01:39.870" end="01:43.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">消えそうな小さな勇気<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中小小的勇气也快要消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e so u na chi i sa na yu u ki</span></p><p begin="01:45.083" end="01:47.723" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">時計が針を刻んでいく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时针仍在铭刻着光阴的流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ke i ga ha ri wo ki za n de ku</span></p><p begin="01:48.503" end="01:53.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">記憶の奥 輝く星読みって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆的深处 仰望着那璀璨的星辰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki o ku no o ku ka ga ya ku ho shi wo mi te</span></p><p begin="01:55.208" end="01:57.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">止まったままの世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个止步不前的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ma 't ta ma ma no se ka i de</span></p><p begin="01:59.545" end="02:01.919" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">閉じ込められた心を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长久以来一直封闭紧锁的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ji ko me ra re ta ko ko ro mo</span></p><p begin="02:03.009" end="02:04.097" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">夜明けの前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黎明来临之前 解除魔法的束缚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo a ke ma e ni ma ho u ga to ke ru no</span></p><p begin="02:04.906" end="02:06.496" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">魔法が解けるの<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo a ke ma e ni ma ho u ga to ke ru no</span></p><p begin="02:07.371" end="02:09.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">スカイラインを越えるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿越那道天际线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ka i ra i n wo ko e ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:10.511" end="02:13.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">大嫌いと大好きの繰り返し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在厌恶与喜爱间反复的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ki ra i to da i su ki no ku ri ka e shi</span></p><p begin="02:14.340" end="02:17.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">そんな日々でもいつか輝き出す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也终将绽放出光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na hi bi de mo i tsu ka ka ga ya ki da su</span></p><p begin="02:18.986" end="02:20.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">飛び出したい衝動が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在渴望飞奔而出的冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi da shi ta i sho u do u ga</span></p><p begin="02:20.780" end="02:22.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">消えてしまう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi da shi ta i sho u do u ga</span></p><p begin="02:22.892" end="02:25.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">君と願いを叶えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你一起实现愿望吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ne ga i wo ka na e yo u</span></p><p begin="02:26.602" end="02:27.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Daisy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Daisy 若是无色透明便能成千般色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Daisy mu sho ku to u me i na ra na ni i ro ni mo na re ru</span></p><p begin="02:27.715" end="02:30.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">無色透明なら何色にもなれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯白中亦能涵煦万千种色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Daisy mu sho ku to u me i na ra na ni i ro ni mo na re ru</span></p><p begin="02:31.491" end="02:35.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">ねえ 鮮やかに染まる光の中踊る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 在染上鲜明色彩的光芒中起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne a za ya ka ni so ma ru hi ka ri no na ka o do ru</span></p><p begin="02:35.727" end="02:39.417" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">そう 雨上がり薄く描いてく様に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 仿如雨后的水珠逐渐散去迎来晴天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So a me a ga ri no shi zu ku ga ka wa i te ku yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:40.036" end="02:44.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">咲いた花この世界を彩ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盛开的花儿为这个世界赋予了色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i ta ha na ko no se ka i wo i ro do 't te i ku</span></p><p begin="02:47.150" end="02:53.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">きっと明日は前より強く<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to a shi ta ha ma e yo ri tsu yo ku</span></p><p begin="02:54.278" end="02:57.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">まだ見ぬ景色へ導いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我去看看那未知的景色吧 划过的流星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da mi nu ke shi ki he mi chi bi i te star line</span></p><p begin="02:58.795" end="03:00.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">スターライ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">见证夜空中划过的流星</span></p><p begin="03:01.951" end="03:05.176" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">大嫌いと大好きの繰り返し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在厌恶与喜爱间反复的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ki ra i to da i su ki no ku ri ka e shi</span></p><p begin="03:05.701" end="03:09.454" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">そんな日々でもいつか輝き出す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也终将绽放出光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na hi bi de mo i tsu ka ka ga ya ki da su</span></p><p begin="03:10.397" end="03:12.062" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">飛び出したい衝動が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在渴望飞奔而出的冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi da shi ta i sho u do u ga</span></p><p begin="03:12.203" end="03:13.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">消えてしまう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te shi ma u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="03:14.320" end="03:16.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">君と願いを叶えよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你一起实现愿望吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to ne ga i wo ka na e yo u</span></p><p begin="03:18.053" end="03:18.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Daisy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Daisy 若是无色透明便能成千般色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Daisy mu sho ku to u me i na ra na ni i ro ni mo na re ru</span></p><p begin="03:19.188" end="03:22.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">無色透明なら何色にもなれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯白中亦能涵煦万千种色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Daisy mu sho ku to u me i na ra na ni i ro ni mo na re ru</span></p><p begin="03:22.938" end="03:24.909" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">ねえ 手を取って踊ろって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 让我们牵手起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne te wo to 't te o do ro 't te</span></p><p begin="03:25.057" end="03:26.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">契機は単純で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">契机其实无比单纯</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 'k ka ke ha ta n ju n de</span></p><p begin="03:27.124" end="03:28.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">そう 覚めないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远不要褪去本色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So sa me na i de</span></p><p begin="03:28.597" end="03:30.919" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">いつだってありのままでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时 只需活出自我就很好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So sa me na i de</span></p><p begin="03:31.427" end="03:36.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">咲いた花この世界を彩ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盛开的花儿为这个世界赋予了色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i ta ha na ko no se ka i wo i ro do 't te i ku</span></p></div></body></tt>